          <div><div class="teaser-date"><time datetime="2025-12-09T08:37:43-06:00">12/09/25</time>
</div><div class="byline">By Sarah Charley</div><p>In 2023, the ALICE experiment was ready for their best year yet, until a mysterious signal threatened everything. As the LHC wraps up its 2025 lead-ion run, physicists recall how they worked together to solve the puzzle.</p></div>

